  "details": "This was found while using vive controls on build 982, so it could be different with other controllers. \nIf you activate a gesture with an Avatar 2.0 avatar, then release the gesture so it returns to neutral, then activate the same gesture again, the gesture instantly activates and deactivates instead of smoothing between neutral and the gesture.\nIn the previous update and the ones prior, the gestures would smooth between the gesture and neutral, but now this appears to be not functioning as intended.",
